      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 13px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ISAR<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Journal of Agriculture and Biology (ISARJAB)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt; is an international, monthly,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        open-access research journal published by ISAR Publisher. This peer-reviewed<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        journal is dedicated to advancing knowledge in the fields of agricultural and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        plant biology science, with a particular focus on crops cultivated in tropical<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        regions. ISARJAB publishes original research, short communications, and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        informative reviews from an applied perspective. It serves as a platform for<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        disseminating valuable insights into agronomy, horticulture, agrotechnology,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        and tropical plant biology. Manuscripts submitted to the journal undergo a<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        rigorous and impartial peer-review process, ensuring the quality and validity<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        of the published content, making it an invaluable resource for researchers and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        professionals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 13px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;ISAR<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Journal of Agriculture and Biology is committed to sharing cutting-edge techniques<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        and applications in the fields of agriculture and biology with researchers,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        students, and scholars in research institutions and universities worldwide. The<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        journal&#039;s primary focus is on crops that thrive in tropical zones, covering<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        their entire growth cycle from seed to quality. It publishes articles that<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        report recent findings in the following areas:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 13px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;Seed<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Science and Technology, Agronomy &amp;amp; Horticulture, Agrotechnology, Ecophysiology,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Crop Protection, Soil Fertility &amp;amp; Organic Farming, Land Use &amp;amp; Land<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Evaluation, Sustainable Agriculture, Plant-Microbe Interactions, Plant Biology,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Plant Biotechnology, Agrobiodiversity, Agroforestry, Biosciences, Biopharmaca, Agroindustry,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Agricultural Engineering, Postharvest Physiology &amp;amp; Technology, Product<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Quality, Agronomy, Aquaculture, Crop Production, Entomology, Food science, Horticulture,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Plant Breeding &amp;amp; Genetics, Plant Pathology, Soil Science, Tissue culture, Anatomy<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        &amp;amp; Physiology, Biotechnology, Biochemistry, Biological engineering, Biology,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Biomedicine, Cancer, Cell and Molecular Biology, Cell biology,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Ecology,&amp;nbsp;Environmental science, Experimental Biology, Genetic engineering,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3082 characters\">        Immunology, Microbiology, Toxicology, Virology, Animal Science &amp;amp; Zoology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
