    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;ISAR<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">    Journal of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[2583-9691]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt; is being published Monthly by<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">    ISAR Publisher. It provides a high-quality, open access, peer-reviewed and fully<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">    refereed international forum in the field of and Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 115%; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; line-height: 115%; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;Journal welcomes original papers, review papers,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">    case studies, and academic exchanges, conceptual framework all the articles<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">    compiled the research outcomes to new developments and approaches in this field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.00938em; text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align); font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The subjects covered by the journal encompass a<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">diverse range of fields and topics, including but not limited to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.00938em; text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);&quot;&gt;Arts,&amp;nbsp;Journalism, Political<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">    Science, Social Studies,&amp;nbsp;Women studies, Fine Arts, Law,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">    Linguistics,&amp;nbsp;Archeology, Communication studies,    Criminology, Cross Cultural studies, History,&amp;nbsp;International Relations,&amp;nbsp;Literature, Media<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">    Studies, Performing arts (Music/Theatre/Dance),<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1958 characters\">    Psychology, Public administration, Religious Studies, Social Welfare,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
